{"id":"935f5eb1f0ba4a25","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-cor-lebesgue.md","title":"Lebesgue Measurability Corollary","display":"cor-lebesgue — Lebesgue Measurability Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-lebesgue","aliases":["58-cor-lebesgue"],"display":"cor-lebesgue — Lebesgue Measurability Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-lebesgue"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-lebesgue</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-lebesgue — Lebesgue Measurability Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\)</span> (Carathéodory measurability, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lebesgue} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lebesgue} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every Borel set is Lebesgue measurable.</li>\n<li>Under AD, all sets are Lebesgue measurable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)$ (Carathéodory measurability, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lebesgue} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)","display":true}],"bytes":956,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-cor-lebesgue.md|58-cor-lebesgue]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["68427bc628af9b8d","9375de7089953a2b"]}